tests/compatibility/bash-pipestatus-typed-native-reference-20260829/prepare.mjs:87: write('HANDOFF.md',`# Typed PIPESTATUS six-probe reference preparation\n\nDate: 2026-08-29. ${result.fail===0?'AUTHOR READY for DIFFERENT preexecution review':'HOLD: DATA controls failed'}. **No actual native authority. P19–P24 all UNRUN; no expected outputs or semantic policy chosen.**\n\nExact root-supplied literals are in PROGRAMS.json and materialized/programs; six hashes/argv/env/empty-stdin bindings in COHORT/REQUESTS. P19 is exactly declare -p PIPESTATUS as first command, no prologue. No eval/source/profile/external command/variable-command/slash lookup/network/private path. Only fixed f invocations, builtin declarations/readonly/assignment/true/false and two finite pipelines. Zero fixtures and zero permitted effects.\n\nParent author5861ec9a8750de90bf38f93a2cd0df66198e8d9f; independent98192974514389759c96d20c7f35fe6050641c76; ROOTcf6c47b8a976bb71bd6dd419c103e23264e71a32 are retained references, not reused authority. SOURCE-AUTH.json binds selected stored parent blobs and fresh tool hashes. Three owner modules change (admission/entry/observation); six remain byte-identical. Old F05 effects permission is removed, all lookups forbidden, IDs/counts/profile/paths are separately versioned. Host FNPIPEOBS1 framing and raw byte preservation remain unchanged.\n\nDATA controls ${result.pass}/12 PASS, ${result.fail} FAIL, ${assertions} assertions. Three changed-module Node syntax children retired. No lifecycle fixture child, Bash, actual entry, native version, compiler/build/product/Worker or network ran. Bootstrap syntax/prepare/controls are the three controller images. All individual raw captures and failures, if any, are retained.\n\nExecutable preseal SHA256 ${presealSha256}; control result ${controlSha256}; exact prospective command string ${commandSha256}. New runtime review/GO templates have strict finite fields and reject PENDING/non-numeric/old-profile authority. issued/expiry/latest-start UTC remain PENDING. Future preprovision must create fresh owned parents and empty journal; bootstrap captures remain absent until the exact noclobber/read-write wrapper. No actual root or runtime slot file is created here.\n\nProspective actual:600s inclusive/setup60s/tail60s, case3s/TERM2/KILL1;7 managed(owner1+Bash6)+4 UNOBSERVED stage reservations(P22/P23 two each)+18 admin=29 proposed slots. Managed peak2+2 unobserved stage allowance+margin1=peak5. Not observed census or OS quota.64KiB/stream,32MiB capture,128MiB work. Exact six-key child environment, owned empty PATH, no BASH_ENV/ENV/exported functions, --noprofile --norc. Initial tool/zsh startup remains trusted host outside child clean-env/raw-capture qualification; no containment or GNU5.3 claim.\n\nActual recipe: DIFFERENT preexec ACCEPT, fresh committed runtime ROOT review/GO/preprovision and fixed UTC window, separate resolved sole-slot DATA review, then EXACT exec_command require_escalated/login:false/no prefix with sealed APPROVAL-PROPOSAL.template.json parameters. No automatic follow-on, old grant reuse or actual request.\n\nOld26/12/37 observations, accounting holds and ambiguities remain unchanged. These six unrun type probes are intended to distinguish startup/readonly indexed versus nonarray/local bindings; preparation alone resolves none. F05 timing and ordinary command-substitution source limits are not rescored.\n`);
